      "params": {
        "text": "A click within 10 px of a pin takes it out. A click anywhere else on the rings adds a pin there: its ring from the distance to the centre, its angle on the disc from the click's angle less the turn. The new pin is appended and every pin is tested; the ones that stay make the next list. A new tune replaces the list, C empties it.",
